    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/656889d88b52310ee978d509b21dacbe.poster.webp?t=1750837280\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/656889d88b52310ee978d509b21dacbe.webp?t=1750837280\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Redneck Brawl Turbo</strong> is a casual auto shooter that unfolds in a quirky world, drawing inspiration from 1980s martial arts comedy movies. Play as a guy who must save his village. Fight waves of wacky enemies. Earn coins and spend them on lessons from the Kung Fu Master, Drunken Master, and White Ninja.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/015e6457ccc957eb7be152e3d5c6705d.poster.webp?t=1750837280\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/015e6457ccc957eb7be152e3d5c6705d.webp?t=1750837280\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BECOME A LEGEND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Pal, the strongest guy in the village, chasing down ninjas who stole the Statue of Prosperity. Explore wild jungles, shady slums, scorching deserts, and more, battling hordes of enemies like punks, convicts, robots, and even aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MEET THE MASTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/f56a7b3167ca339bb3f71320dc1cdd15.avif?t=1750837280\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Kung Fu Master: Master the art of ki energy and learn how to transform it into devastating weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Drunken Master: Unorthodox but effective, this mentor will teach you creative combat tactics using destructive gadgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf White Ninja: With a sharp mind honed by solving Rubik\u2019s cubes, he teaches you lifehacks like reanimating yourself with a car battery and many others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/2694c28151b672682d77df0c4364236d.poster.avif?t=1750837280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/2694c28151b672682d77df0c4364236d.webm?t=1750837280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/2694c28151b672682d77df0c4364236d.mp4?t=1750837280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HUMOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game\u2019s charm lies not only in its dynamic gameplay but also in its humor. From funny stories to ridiculous descriptions, this game delivers humor in every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GET STRONG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/3077f80b01036fb0df39304347d9a7a7.poster.avif?t=1750837280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/3077f80b01036fb0df39304347d9a7a7.webm?t=1750837280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/3077f80b01036fb0df39304347d9a7a7.mp4?t=1750837280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pump iron, run laps, and become a force to be reckoned with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUDDIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/e749842fbc881351633ef951408ceeff.poster.avif?t=1750837280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/e749842fbc881351633ef951408ceeff.webm?t=1750837280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/e749842fbc881351633ef951408ceeff.mp4?t=1750837280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit the village tavern where your friends gather. Treat a buddy to a mug of frothy drink, and they\u2019ll gladly embark on a mission in your place. Each buddy has unique quirks or skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ENTERTAINMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/a968a48034b954ecf814858d227ee1de.poster.avif?t=1750837280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/a968a48034b954ecf814858d227ee1de.webm?t=1750837280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/a968a48034b954ecf814858d227ee1de.mp4?t=1750837280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s plenty to do in the village tavern:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Fishing pond. Catch and collect 43 species of fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Treasure chest. Unlock treasure chests with your lock-picking skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Wheel of Fortune. Try your luck and win valuable prizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Hand-Crafted Art: Every level, character, and ability is hand-drawn, creating a truly unique visual experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Fluid Animations: Hundreds of meticulously crafted skeletal animations guarantee smooth and crisp movements, even in slow motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Customizable Abilities: Mix or Match techniques of Kung Fu Master: Combine 45 abilities or match them to create 15 super abilities. Make powerful customized builds for a specific situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Destructive Gadgets: Utilize 12 unique devices from the Drunken Master, each with different situational advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Diverse Enemies: Face off against 98 unique foes, including snowmen, ninjas, grannies, gangsters, maniacs, robots, aliens, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Formidable Bosses: Conquer 35 unique bosses, from the Skeleton and Punk to the Dragon, Doctor, Super Soldier, Alien Mothership, and Terminator T-300.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Vibrant Levels: Explore 13 unique locations, including wild jungles, criminal slums, arctic tundras, robotic factories, and exotic deserts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Challenging Missions: Complete 195 missions to earn ki energy and trophies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to join Pal on his epic quest? The village\u2019s fate is in your hands!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/656889d88b52310ee978d509b21dacbe.poster.webp?t=1750837280\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/656889d88b52310ee978d509b21dacbe.webp?t=1750837280\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Redneck Brawl Turbo</strong> is a casual auto shooter that unfolds in a quirky world, drawing inspiration from 1980s martial arts comedy movies. Play as a guy who must save his village. Fight waves of wacky enemies. Earn coins and spend them on lessons from the Kung Fu Master, Drunken Master, and White Ninja.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/015e6457ccc957eb7be152e3d5c6705d.poster.webp?t=1750837280\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/015e6457ccc957eb7be152e3d5c6705d.webp?t=1750837280\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BECOME A LEGEND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Pal, the strongest guy in the village, chasing down ninjas who stole the Statue of Prosperity. Explore wild jungles, shady slums, scorching deserts, and more, battling hordes of enemies like punks, convicts, robots, and even aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MEET THE MASTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/f56a7b3167ca339bb3f71320dc1cdd15.avif?t=1750837280\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf 