36fb0df39304347d9a7a7.mp4?t=1750837280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pump iron, run laps, and become a force to be reckoned with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUDDIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/e749842fbc881351633ef951408ceeff.poster.avif?t=1750837280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/e749842fbc881351633ef951408ceeff.webm?t=1750837280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/e749842fbc881351633ef951408ceeff.mp4?t=1750837280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit the village tavern where your friends gather. Treat a buddy to a mug of frothy drink, and they\u2019ll gladly embark on a mission in your place. Each buddy has unique quirks or skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ENTERTAINMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/a968a48034b954ecf814858d227ee1de.poster.avif?t=1750837280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/a968a48034b954ecf814858d227ee1de.webm?t=1750837280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858680/extras/a968a48034b954ecf814858d227ee1de.mp4?t=1750837280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s plenty to do in the village tavern:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Fishing pond. Catch and collect 43 species of fish.</p><p class